data: {"type":"REASONING_MESSAGE_CONTENT","messageId":"56bddbfe-174a-4881-afe4-892b9f8e7cb6","delta":"**Generating Visualizations**\n\nI'm now focusing on visualization creation using `crear_grafica`. My parameters are set for a heatmap (`tipo`: \"mapa_calor\") to analyze exported energy. Specifically, I'm mapping \"dia\" to x-axis, \"hora\" to y-axis, and \"kwh_exportado\" for the value, with \"kWh\" as the unit. The title is \"Mapa de calor de energía exportada por hora y día (Septiembre 2026)\". I expect this to reveal the daily solar generation pattern, peaking around 11:00 AM.\n\n\n"}

